{"parse": {"title": "发酵鲱鱼干", "pageid": 69051, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"发酵鲱鱼干\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c1/Item-270002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"发酵鲱鱼干\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>发酵鲱鱼干</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#270002</div></div><hr /><div>发酵制成的鱼干，风味独特、气息浓郁。可在荒原中投喂给魔精，回复情绪值。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">一些学者认为，许多水生魔精对发酵鲱鱼的气味有着独特的偏好，另一些则认为那是因为它们没有鼻子。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">毛绒臻选</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "发酵鲱鱼干"}}